Feature: Calculate Applied Quantity (apl_qty) in Inventory Transactions

  Background:
    Given a database connection to Unity Catalog purgo_databricks
    And a schema named purgo_playground
    And loaded data from Inventory_Txn_Applied_Qty.xlsx for txn_id, ref_txn_qty, cumulative_txn_qty, cumulative_ref_ord_sched_qty, ref_ord_sched_qty, prior_cumulative_txn_qty, prior_cumulative_ref_ord_sched_qty

  Scenario Outline: Calculate apl_qty for positive ref_txn_qty with cumulative_txn_qty >= cumulative_ref_ord_sched_qty
    Given ref_txn_qty is > 0
    And cumulative_txn_qty is >= cumulative_ref_ord_sched_qty
    When prior_cumulative_ref_ord_sched_qty is < prior_cumulative_txn_qty
    Then set apl_qty to <calculated_apl_qty>
    Else set apl_qty to ref_ord_sched_qty
    And insert into purgo_playground.f_inv_movmnt_apl_qty (txn_id, apl_qty)

    Examples:
      | txn_id | ref_txn_qty | cumulative_txn_qty | cumulative_ref_ord_sched_qty | ref_ord_sched_qty | prior_cumulative_txn_qty | prior_cumulative_ref_ord_sched_qty | calculated_apl_qty |
      | 1      | 50          | 100                | 90                           | 50               | 40                       | 30                                  | 40.0               |

  Scenario Outline: Calculate apl_qty for positive ref_txn_qty with cumulative_ref_ord_sched_qty >= cumulative_txn_qty
    Given ref_txn_qty is > 0
    And cumulative_ref_ord_sched_qty is >= cumulative_txn_qty
    When prior_cumulative_ref_ord_sched_qty is > prior_cumulative_txn_qty
    Then set apl_qty to <calculated_apl_qty>
    Else set apl_qty to ref_txn_qty
    And insert into purgo_playground.f_inv_movmnt_apl_qty (txn_id, apl_qty)

    Examples:
      | txn_id | ref_txn_qty | cumulative_txn_qty | cumulative_ref_ord_sched_qty | ref_ord_sched_qty | prior_cumulative_txn_qty | prior_cumulative_ref_ord_sched_qty | calculated_apl_qty |
      | 3      | 20          | 60                 | 100                          | 30                | 30                       | 25                                  | 20.0               |

  Scenario Outline: Calculate apl_qty for negative ref_txn_qty where cumulative_txn_qty != 0 and cumulative_ref_ord_sched_qty > 0
    Given ref_txn_qty is < 0
    And cumulative_txn_qty is not equal to 0
    And cumulative_ref_ord_sched_qty is > 0
    Then set apl_qty to ref_txn_qty
    And insert into purgo_playground.f_inv_movmnt_apl_qty (txn_id, apl_qty)

    Examples:
      | txn_id | ref_txn_qty | cumulative_txn_qty | cumulative_ref_ord_sched_qty | ref_ord_sched_qty | prior_cumulative_txn_qty | prior_cumulative_ref_ord_sched_qty | apl_qty |
      | 2      | -10         | 80                 | 70                           | 40                | 50                       | 45                                  | -10.0   |

  Scenario Outline: Default case for apl_qty calculation
    Given none of the conditions are met
    Then set apl_qty to NULL
    And insert into purgo_playground.f_inv_movmnt_apl_qty (txn_id, apl_qty)

    Examples:
      | txn_id | ref_txn_qty | cumulative_txn_qty | cumulative_ref_ord_sched_qty | ref_ord_sched_qty | prior_cumulative_txn_qty | prior_cumulative_ref_ord_sched_qty |

